<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to 14 August -ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to 14 August -ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in the Eurobond and related markets rose to $1.036 trillion in the week to August 14 from $1.034 trillion in the previous week, International Securities Market Association figures show (in billions of dollars).</p>
<p>					    LATEST WEEK	PREVIOUS WEEK</p>
<p> PRIMARY MARKET:			   48.08		     42.36</p>
<p> OF WHICH U.S. DOLLAR ISSUES:	  24.70		     20.66</p>
<p> SECONDARY MARKET:			988.09		    991.80</p>
<p> OF WHICH U.S. DOLLAR ISSUES:	 268.40		    727.59</p>
<p> CLEARED THROUGH EUROCLEAR	    728.65		    737.91</p>
<p> CLEARED THROUGH CEDEL		  307.52		    296.25</p>
<p>--London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
